From 6121fa64378e9a4f2e5a957fe1b82d785c69c796 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:13:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 405/407] Unified: MJCF mass properties of all the solids of a
 part; densities and masses by name

A Compound has no MatrixOfInertia: 300 of a model's 365 parts got a
placeholder inertia and their box's centre (362 mm off). The solids are
added with the parallel axis theorem. --mjcf-density map.json gives
densities and masses by name pattern ({"density": {...}, "mass":
{...}}: a bought part's catalogue mass); a Mass or Density property of
the part is used too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
